==== ScaleWorldIcon ====
If the UseWorldItem parameter is true, then the ScaleWorldIcon parameter specifies the scale for texture.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ScaleWorldIcon = 2.0,
</syntaxhighlight>

